<title>USA: Windsor Heights, Iowa, won by Cronin  &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Windsor Heights, Iowa, won by Cronin  &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., said it won $1.775 million of Windsor Heights, Iowa, essential corporate purpose Taxable bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 6.89 percent.</p>
